{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.tenka.coffee",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她拿着台本站在茶水间",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.tenka.coffee",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.tenka.coffee",
    "idolId": "tenka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……那，我去确认一下谈话节目的台本……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，拜托了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嗯……呃……下一个日程是……在录音棚碰头……来着……？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，是啊。现在一个人管理日程也没问题了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……不过还有时间，趁现在稍微休息一下吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嗯…………制作人先生……喝咖啡吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，让甜花给我泡不太好，我自己来吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "没关系……换换心情……制作人先生，等着……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊。那就拜托你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……嗯。甜花，会好好泡的……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "喏，泡好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦哦，谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "呃，那个……会不会太浓……？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，很好喝。不过，能让甜花给我泡咖啡，感觉真不可思议。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嘿嘿，太好了……甜花也……一点点，在变化……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是啊。真的在很多方面成长了。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "偶像的工作……最近，也很多……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "工作排得很满，会很辛苦吧，没事吗？如果有勉强的事，马上告诉我。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "嗯……那时候会那样做的……不过现在……很开心……所以，没事……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "……呐，制作人先生。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "谢谢你把甜花，变成偶像……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么突然？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "最近很忙……没能慢慢……说话……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "其实……一直，想说道谢……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没什么值得道谢的事。我只是帮了点忙而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "不是的……甜花能走到这里……一定是，因为有制作人先生在……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "要是没有制作人先生……甜花就算摔倒了……也起不来……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是因为有我在，而是因为甜花努力了，才能成为这么棒的偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "能那么努力……也是多亏了制作人先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "tenka",
        "text": "制作人先生……好好把甜花，当作偶像培养起来了……"
      }
    }
  },
